	"VisualScript": {
		"Description": "The feature test's visual script. Event.Create runs a check of every built-in node kind but the contact and click events (Contacts.sgraph and Clicks.sgraph have those), each reported through TestReporter by the function Check: Checks counts the passed ones and Done is set after the last. The waiting kinds come last, since each suspends the checks after it. The input events count into InputEvents (test runs have no input). The custom event Add adds its Amount to Score: the graph raises it with Event.Send, VisualScriptTests from C#.",
